Z||000000||theogre||09-13-2001||07:14 PM||||I added a short article to the engine section about engine mounts. It should help explain the liquid filled mount used by many of the 4 cylinder cars.<P>After some one indicated a problem... I checked the settings for the frames.<P>The frames have always been resize enabled but there was no border. That makes it dificult for those that want to resize. I added a thing border however IE5x appears to have a bug. It will resize the frames, even with no border, but it refuses to show the resize arrow cursor. Just grab the edge of the box and resize it anyway. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif"> <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||2
